# Real World Application

IT Support professionals use File Explorer, Task Manager, Settings, and Control Panel daily to troubleshoot Windows user issues. They also use SSH and SCP to administer Linux systems remotely and securely transfer files. Understanding Public and Private IP addressing and NAT helps diagnose connectivity issues in enterprise environments.

